  "name": "launch-1",
  "note": "3D75 (800A197C -> 80213758/80213AAC) launches units that are aboard a mothership: for one of the seven captains it selects every unit in that captain's ship (ship table 8015E85C/60, aboard lists 8015E864), otherwise only the named pilot's aboard unit, then places them around the ship one every 4 frames with the launch SE and removes them from the aboard list (801EB0D4). Units only board through the player's move command (801CD0E4 -> 801EAF88), so this stage sets up ブライト's アウドムラ via the mothership step and ドモン right next to it; the input moves ドモン onto the ship and ends the phase, and the enemy-phase event of turn 1 runs 3D75 999 (= 46). The type-0 header compares the 0-based turn counter 8010F5EA (0 during the first turn, shown as ターン数 1), so turn 1 / enemy phase is header [0, 2].",
